---
const experiences = [
  {
    company: 'Accenture',
    role: 'DevOps Engineer, Analyst',
    period: 'Dec 2022 – Present',
    location: 'Indore, India',
    bullets: [
      'Reduced release cycle time by 45% by designing end-to-end CI/CD pipelines using Azure DevOps, Terraform, Docker, and Maven for 10+ microservices.',
      'Operated and scaled AKS clusters (6 clusters, 18 nodes) hosting ~60 services; authored Helm charts and standardised Ingress to improve deployment success rate from 85% → 99%.',
      'Led Terraform IaC programme provisioning 100+ cloud resources; built reusable modules and CI checks, reducing environment provisioning time from 4 days to 2 hours.',
      'Built a custom drift-detection tool (Python) monitoring Terraform state, decreasing configuration drift incidents by 70% and preventing two critical outages.',
      'Automated cost controls via Python/Bash: scheduled teardown of non-prod resources (saving £1,200/mo) and dynamic pipeline-agent provisioning (cut agent spend 40%).',
      'Implemented Policy-as-Code with OPA/Rego + Gatekeeper and integrated SonarQube/Snyk into pipelines, preventing 95% of policy violations in PRs (DevSecOps).',
    ],
  },
];
---

<section id="experience" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div data-animate>
      <p class="section-label">Work</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Experience</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="exp-list" role="list">
      {experiences.map((job, i) => (
        <li class="exp-item" data-animate style={`transition-delay: ${i * 0.08}s`}>
          <div class="exp-header">
            <div>
              <h3 class="exp-role">{job.role}</h3>
              <p class="exp-company">{job.company} <span class="exp-location">· {job.location}</span></p>
            </div>
            <p class="exp-period">{job.period}</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="exp-bullets" role="list">
            {job.bullets.map((bullet) => <li>{bullet}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.section {
  padding-block: var(--section-pad);
}

.exp-list {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 2.5rem;
}

.exp-item {
  border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  padding-left: 1.5rem;
  position: relative;
}

.exp-item::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: -5px;
  top: 0.4rem;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: var(--color-accent);
}

.exp-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.exp-role {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
}

.exp-company {
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.exp-location {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  font-weight: 400;
}

.exp-period {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding-top: 0.2rem;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.exp-bullets {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.6rem;
}

.exp-bullets li {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  padding-left: 1.3em;
  position: relative;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.exp-bullets li::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0.65em;
  width: 6px;
  height: 1.5px;
  background-color: var(--color-accent);
}
</style>
